    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "just finished a brutal 3 hour hiit session in the heat and im feeling super weak and my legs are cramping like crazy. i have some potassium chloride supplements here, should i just take two big doses (like 2000mg) right now to get my electrolytes back up?",
