    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk im just really shaky and the cramps wont stop... i really dont want to go to the er if i dont have to. if i split the dose up and take like 500mg every 20 mins instead of all at once, is that okay? i feel like i really need the potassium right now to stop these cramps.",
