      "content": "Splitting the dose does not make it safe, as even 500mg of potassium chloride is a massive amount that can still overload your kidneys and disrupt your heart's electrical signals. Potassium chloride supplements cause severe gastrointestinal pain if they come into direct contact with the digestive tract, which is especially dangerous right now when your muscles are cramping and your body is prone to spasms. Because your symptoms suggest a significant electrolyte imbalance that could lead to dangerous cardiac complications, the safest course of action is to stop exercising and call emergency services or go to the ER immediately rather than self-medicating.",
